HST Office: the Home tab keeps its "Kiểu" group beside the banner; its right-hand block is the group "Công cụ".

- Writer, Sheets, Slides notebookbar.ui, Home: the right-hand block (the per-tab menu and the HST commands)
  becomes a group of left-aligned rows with the caption "Công cụ": "Trang đầu ▾" (menu unchanged), then
  Writer "Văn bản hành chính", Sheets sort/filter, Slides "Trình chiếu", then "Tìm tính năng". It is about
  half as wide as before and still folds first into its button. "Tìm và thay thế" moves to an icon-only button
  after the indent buttons of the paragraph group (Sheets: alignment group); the "Trang đầu" menu also offers
  "Tìm tính năng".
- Sheets, Home: "Có điều kiện" and "Kiểu dáng bảng" are two small buttons stacked, as Excel's narrow Styles
  group, so the group needs about half its former width.
- svx style gallery (Writer, Home ▸ Kiểu): the view needs one preview and takes the width the ribbon has left,
  so it shows as many previews as fit instead of the group folding; the page buttons are a narrow column.
  With one preview it shows the current style. A name wider than a preview wraps to two centred lines, and
  large heading fonts are capped so two lines fit.
- vcl builder: a ribbon label with the same words as the command label but a line break or no trailing "…" is
  shown instead of it ("Tìm tính năng" for "Tìm tính năng…"); other .ui labels never replace a command label.
- vi translations: the caption "Công cụ". solenv a11y suppressions: the two new items without a label of their
  own (Find & Replace icon, the menu entry) take the command's label at runtime, as their neighbours.
No new collapse engine: the groups still fold from the end through the existing PriorityMergedHBox.

